        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋado Nam m'obokere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waci ri Joisiraili jogik jowokethi kambi yuwaŋ Pihahiroth, i dier Migdol kodi Nam M'obokere cegin gi Balzefon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Farawo bino paro nike Joisiraili fodi jotangatanga i lowo me aka thim ogeŋo jo kadho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino miyo go bedo gi wictek aka go bino luwo win. Abino limo dwoŋ paran kwoŋ Farawo gi jolweny pere je ŋey Jomisir jowonyal ŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth.” Aka Joisiraili jotimo ameno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo owaci ri Farawo nike Joisiraili joringo, go gi jodhum pere jowiro paro pajo aka jowaco ni, “Aŋo ma watimo! Waweyo Joisiraili kadho m'oyido jobedo ŋecin mawan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Farawo okwanyo cawila pere ma lweny gi jolweny pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go okwanyo cawilin pere je kiri gi jolweny 600 ma jober loyo, gi jomituka pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth omiyo Farawo bedo gi wictek to luwo Joisiraili m'oyido jokadho gi miseni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny pa Jomisir, kayinin pajo, cawilin pajo kodi jogwey joriemo jo aka jomako jo kam'oyido joketh'iye kambi dho Nam M'obokere cegin gi Pihahiroth kodi Balzefon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Farawo ocore cegin, Joisiraili jotiŋo waŋ gin malo, aka neni, Jomisir oyido joŋanjo joluwo jo. Jobwok swa aka joywak ri Rwoth wokonyi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco ri Musa ni, “Kaliele oyido ongoye i Misir m'ikelo wan tho i thim ka? Neni gim'itimo gi wodho wan wok i Misir! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakiwaco rin mafodi wakiay nike gime bino timirok? Wawaco rin nike iwey wan wabedi ŋecin pa Jomisir. Ber oyido wabedi ŋecin ma wakitho ka i thim.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa odwoko ji ni, “Wikiri wilwor, cungi win matek, aka Rwoth bino botho win konon. Jomisir ma wineno me wikibino neno jo kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth bino lwenyo riwin aka ongoye kony win timo gimoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Raŋo wiywak ran? Waci ri Joisiraili jowomedere yuwaŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiŋi luth perin malo aka iriey cingin i wi nam wotiakere i diere, ŋey Joisiraili jowoŋadi nam kam'othwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka abino miyo Jomisir wictek to joluwo jo i nam, ŋey anwaŋ dwoŋ paran kwoŋ Farawo, jolweny pere, cawilin pere, kodi jogwey kayinin pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'akengila jo, Jomisir jobino ŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Were m'oyido telo yuwiy jolweny pa Isiraili ogik yuŋey jo, aka siro ma pondeponde bende ogik yuŋey jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i dier Jomisir kodi Joisiraili. Pondeponde oloko piny macol ri Jomisir, to miyo Joisiraili lero. Aka jok'onyalo bedo cegin wor gipi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Musa orieyo cinge i wi nam, aka Rwoth obaro nam gi koyo matek ma yuwok ceŋ wor gipi to timo lowo m'othwo iye. Pi otiakere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Joisiraili joluwo i dier nam i lowo m'othwo gi pi i kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomisir joluwo jo aka jodonjo i nam gi kayinin pajo, cawilin kodi jogwey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafodi ŋamba k'oriedo, Rwoth oŋiyo piny kwoŋ Jomisir wok i siro ma mac gi pondeponde aka omiyo jo kirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth omiyo tiendi cawilin pajo moko, ŋey woth wobedi rijo matek. Jomisir jowaco ni, “Rwoth lwenyo gi wan ri Joisiraili. Weyi wawok win ka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Riey cingin i wi nam, ŋey pi wogiki kwoŋ Jomisir, cawilin pajo, kodi jogwey kayinin pajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Musa orieyo cinge i wi nam, aka munyo piny oyawere pi ogik i kare. Jomisir jotemo ringo, to Rwoth obolo jo i nam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
